      About the Institute
    </h1>
    <p class="section-desc" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #383633;">
      Apex Technical Institute was started to provide practical, hands-on engineering education taught directly by practicing senior software practitioners.
    </p>
