  <section class="detail-section">
    <h2>How we teach</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      Rather than long video lectures, our programs revolve around writing production code, configuring real infrastructure, and submitting assignments for peer and staff pull request reviews.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cohorts are intentionally kept small so every student receives weekly 1-on-1 mentorship, architectural feedback, and project guidance.
    </p>
  </section>

